  "Description": "ASSIGN PRODUCTION LINE\n\nNeed to preset what is being produced on a production line.  Sets Input Product, Output Product (MasterItem), Qty per Batch, Batch, Job etc.  It is a Takeon, not a manufacture process\n\nNeed a custom table to stoe this assignment.  Currently the printers are L1, L2, L3 (which maps to LINE1, Line2, LINE3 etc.)  The webtemplate on Location filters by the printer so logging in with print L1 only shows Line 1 assignment.",
